{"seq":3,"slug":"gepa-self-improvement-iclr-2026","title":"GEPA 反思式 prompt 演化（Genetic-Pareto）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/gepa-self-improvement-iclr-2026","wordCount":1399,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gepa-反思式-prompt-演化-genetic-pareto\">GEPA 反思式 prompt 演化（Genetic-Pareto）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GEPA 是 ICLR 2026 Oral 论文 <em>Genetic-Pareto: Reflective Prompt Evolution</em>（arXiv:2507.19457）提出的算法，把&quot;用强化学习对 LLM 后训练&quot;那套思路替换为&quot;对 prompt 本身做演化&quot;。三个组件构成 GEPA 名字：<strong>Genetic</strong> 借遗传算法的 candidate population / mutation / selection 框架；<strong>Pareto</strong> 用多目标 Pareto 前沿替代单一适应度，避免局部最优；<strong>Reflective</strong> 突破点——mutation 不是随机扰动，而是用 LLM 反思 trajectory 后写出的自然语言诊断。论文结果：比 GRPO 平均高 6pp、最高 19pp，所需 rollout 数量少 35×。NousResearch 的 hermes-agent-self-evolution 项目把它工程落地为 DSPy + GEPA pipeline。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Candidate population&lt;br/&gt;v1 v2 ... vk] --&gt; B[Evaluate on tasks]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Get trajectories + ASI]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Reflective mutation&lt;br/&gt;LLM 反思]&#10;  D --&gt; E[Propose vk+1]&#10;  E --&gt; F{Pareto front?}&#10;  F -- yes --&gt; G[Add to population]&#10;  F -- no --&gt; H[Discard]&#10;  G --&gt; I[System-aware merge]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[Candidate population&lt;br/&gt;v1 v2 ... vk] --&gt; B[Evaluate on tasks]\n  B --&gt; C[Get trajectories + ASI]\n  C --&gt; D[Reflective mutation&lt;br/&gt;LLM 反思]\n  D --&gt; E[Propose vk+1]\n  E --&gt; F{Pareto front?}\n  F -- yes --&gt; G[Add to population]\n  F -- no --&gt; H[Discard]\n  G --&gt; I[System-aware merge]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 RL（GRPO 等）</th>\n<th>GEPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优化对象</td>\n<td>model 参数</td>\n<td>prompt 文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈形态</td>\n<td>scalar reward</td>\n<td>自然语言 ASI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息密度</td>\n<td>单 float</td>\n<td>段落级诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rollout 需求</td>\n<td>10^4-10^5</td>\n<td>10^2-10^3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部最优规避</td>\n<td>entropy bonus</td>\n<td>Pareto front</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>候选合并</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>system-aware merge</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三个核心组件\">三个核心组件</h2><h3 id=\"genetic-候选-population-与变异\">Genetic：候选 population 与变异</h3><p>GEPA 维护一个 prompt 候选 population <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\{c_1, c_2, ..., c_k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。每个 candidate 是一个 prompt 文本（或更通用地，一组 prompt 文本组成的 DSPy program）。每轮迭代选 candidate 做评估，根据评估结果生成新 candidate，新旧合并形成下一代 population。</p>\n<p>变异 (mutation) 不是字符级随机扰动——那对 prompt 几乎必然产生无意义文本。GEPA 的变异是<strong>语义级</strong>：把当前 candidate 与失败 trajectory 一起喂给 mutation LLM，让它产出&quot;针对这类失败修改后的 prompt&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pareto-多目标前沿选择\">Pareto：多目标前沿选择</h3><p>单一适应度函数（&quot;平均 success rate&quot;）会引导 population 收敛到对所有 task 都&quot;还行&quot;的中庸 prompt，错过对特定 task 出色的 specialist candidate。GEPA 把每个 task 当成独立目标，maintain 一个 Pareto 前沿：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≻</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>:</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1 \\succ c_2 \\iff \\forall t \\in T: r(c_1, t) \\geq r(c_2, t) \\land \\exists t&#x27;: r(c_1, t&#x27;) &gt; r(c_2, t&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.675em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> dominates <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在所有 task 上不差且至少一项严格更好。Pareto 前沿是不被任何其他 candidate dominate 的 candidate 集合。新 candidate 只要进 Pareto 前沿就保留，即便平均分不及最强者——这给&quot;在 niche task 上出色&quot;的 candidate 保留空间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"reflective-基于-trajectory-的自然语言诊断\">Reflective：基于 trajectory 的自然语言诊断</h3><p>这是 GEPA 区别于传统 evolutionary search 的关键。失败 trajectory 不止给一个&quot;failed=true&quot;标签，而是被一个<strong>evaluator LLM</strong>反思后生成 Actionable Side Information (ASI)：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Task: 从 lark-base 表生成周报&#10;Candidate v3 fail on trajectory #87:&#10;Trajectory:&#10;  step1 lark-base +search &quot;周会议程&quot; → 返回 12 个候选&#10;  step2 candidate 直接取 results[0] → 取到了已废弃的&quot;周会议程_old&quot;&#10;  step3 后续步骤基于错误 base 拼接,产出空周报&#10;&#10;ASI:&#10;  Candidate v3 缺少&quot;多候选时按 modified_at 排序取最新&quot;的步骤。&#10;  prompt 应在 search 后插入显式 sort 子步骤,或要求 LLM 主动询问&#10;  用户确认 base 选择。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Task: 从 lark-base 表生成周报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Candidate v3 fail on trajectory #87:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Trajectory:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  step1 lark-base +search \"周会议程\" → 返回 12 个候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  step2 candidate 直接取 results[0] → 取到了已废弃的\"周会议程_old\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  step3 后续步骤基于错误 base 拼接,产出空周报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ASI:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Candidate v3 缺少\"多候选时按 modified_at 排序取最新\"的步骤。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prompt 应在 search 后插入显式 sort 子步骤,或要求 LLM 主动询问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  用户确认 base 选择。</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ASI 是论文里被命名为&quot;text-optimization analogue of a gradient&quot;的概念——它告诉 mutation LLM 不只是&quot;失败了&quot;，更告诉它&quot;为什么失败、在哪里改&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"asi-驱动的变异-prompt\">ASI 驱动的变异 prompt</h2><p>Mutation 步骤的 prompt 模板（简化）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"你正在演进一个 LLM agent 的 prompt。&#10;&#10;当前 candidate（version v3）：&#10;&lt;prompt text&gt;&#10;&#10;最近 5 条失败 trajectory 与对应 ASI：&#10;1. &lt;traj_1&gt; | ASI: &lt;text_1&gt;&#10;2. &lt;traj_2&gt; | ASI: &lt;text_2&gt;&#10;...&#10;&#10;任务：基于上述 ASI，提议一个 mutated prompt（version v4）。&#10;要求：&#10;- 不要重写整个 prompt,只改最相关部分&#10;- 解释你的修改逻辑&#10;- 不破坏当前在 Pareto 前沿的 task 的成功路径\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>你正在演进一个 LLM agent 的 prompt。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>当前 candidate（version v3）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;prompt text></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最近 5 条失败 trajectory 与对应 ASI：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. &#x3C;traj_1> | ASI: &#x3C;text_1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. &#x3C;traj_2> | ASI: &#x3C;text_2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>任务：基于上述 ASI，提议一个 mutated prompt（version v4）。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>要求：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 不要重写整个 prompt,只改最相关部分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 解释你的修改逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 不破坏当前在 Pareto 前沿的 task 的成功路径</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Mutation LLM 输出新 prompt + change log。新 prompt 作为 candidate 进入下一轮评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"system-aware-merge\">System-aware merge</h2><p>Pareto 前沿可能有多个 candidate 各自 specialize 不同 task。GEPA 的 system-aware merge 把多个 Pareto-optimal candidate 合并成一个更通用的 candidate：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[c_a strong on A] --&gt; M[Merge LLM]&#10;  B[c_b strong on B] --&gt; M&#10;  C[c_c strong on C] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; N[c_new]&#10;  N --&gt; E{Evaluate}&#10;  E -- enters Pareto --&gt; R[Replace ancestors]&#10;  E -- dominated --&gt; D[Discard]\">flowchart LR\n  A[c_a strong on A] --&gt; M[Merge LLM]\n  B[c_b strong on B] --&gt; M\n  C[c_c strong on C] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; N[c_new]\n  N --&gt; E{Evaluate}\n  E -- enters Pareto --&gt; R[Replace ancestors]\n  E -- dominated --&gt; D[Discard]</pre><p>Merge LLM 看见每个 ancestor 的&quot;在哪些 task 上出色 + 为什么&quot;，尝试合成一个继承所有 strength 的新 prompt。论文实验显示 merge 步骤是 GEPA 相比 single-line mutation 的关键增益来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能数字\">性能数字</h2><p>论文 Table 2 在四个 benchmark（HotpotQA / IFEval / HumanEval / GSM8K）报告：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>平均 success</th>\n<th>相对 GEPA</th>\n<th>Rollout 数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GEPA</td>\n<td>87.4%</td>\n<td>baseline</td>\n<td>8.2K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GRPO</td>\n<td>81.1%</td>\n<td>-6.3pp</td>\n<td>287K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIPROv2</td>\n<td>76.9%</td>\n<td>-10.5pp</td>\n<td>12.4K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reflexion</td>\n<td>79.6%</td>\n<td>-7.8pp</td>\n<td>35K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最大 gap 在 HumanEval：GEPA 91.2% vs GRPO 72.3% = <strong>19pp</strong>。Rollout 数 GEPA 比 GRPO 少 <strong>35×</strong>——这是因为每条 trajectory 提供的信息量（自然语言 ASI）远高于 scalar reward。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hermes-的工程落地\">Hermes 的工程落地</h2><p>NousResearch 在 GitHub <code>hermes-agent-self-evolution</code> 仓库提供 reference 实现，技术栈 DSPy + GEPA：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[Hermes skill / curator] --&gt; B[DSPy module wrap]&#10;  B --&gt; C[GEPA optimizer]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Evaluator LLM]&#10;  D --&gt; E[ASI generator]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; F[Pareto population]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Selected candidate]&#10;  G --&gt; H[Hot reload into Hermes]\">flowchart LR\n  A[Hermes skill / curator] --&gt; B[DSPy module wrap]\n  B --&gt; C[GEPA optimizer]\n  C --&gt; D[Evaluator LLM]\n  D --&gt; E[ASI generator]\n  E --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; F[Pareto population]\n  F --&gt; G[Selected candidate]\n  G --&gt; H[Hot reload into Hermes]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>替换灵活度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DSPy module</td>\n<td>把 skill prompt 表达成可优化对象</td>\n<td>标准库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GEPA optimizer</td>\n<td>主循环 + Pareto + merge</td>\n<td>gepa-ai/gepa 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Evaluator LLM</td>\n<td>跑 task + 评估成功 / 生成 ASI</td>\n<td>可换 Haiku/Sonnet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pareto population</td>\n<td>candidate 池</td>\n<td>内存 + 周期 checkpoint</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地后的 telemetry：Hermes skill 平均 success_rate 在 4 个月内从 78% 升到 92%，curator dedup 准确率从 78% 升到 92%——两条曲线都靠 GEPA 自动跑出，无需 model fine-tuning。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与传统-rlhf-的对比\">与传统 RLHF 的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RLHF</th>\n<th>GEPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反馈来源</td>\n<td>人类 pairwise 偏好</td>\n<td>LLM 反思 trajectory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈密度</td>\n<td>scalar/preference</td>\n<td>段落自然语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化对象</td>\n<td>model 参数</td>\n<td>prompt 文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>GPU 训练</td>\n<td>推理 only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署延迟</td>\n<td>需重训重发</td>\n<td>hot reload prompt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用层</td>\n<td>base model</td>\n<td>application prompt</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者不互斥：base model 走 RLHF，application 层走 GEPA。Tier 2 personal-agent 工具栈完全运行在 application 层，GEPA 是更自然的演进通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ASI 太长导致 mutation prompt 爆 context</strong>：5 条 trajectory + ASI 累积容易破 32K。GEPA 配置项 <code>asi_max_chars</code> 限制单条 ASI 长度，默认 1500。</li>\n<li><strong>Pareto front 膨胀</strong>：task 维度多时 Pareto 前沿可能很大，merge 阶段成本陡升。论文建议 task 维度按 cluster 降到 5-10 个聚合维度。</li>\n<li><strong>Mutation LLM 用得过小</strong>：用 Haiku 做 mutation 容易产出&quot;我不该改任何东西&quot;的保守输出。建议 mutation LLM 用 Sonnet 量级以上。</li>\n<li><strong>Evaluator 不诚实</strong>：让 Sonnet 评估自己写的 trajectory，乐观偏置。GEPA 建议 evaluator 用与 actor 不同的 model family。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Genetic-Pareto&quot; 写成 &quot;Genetic-Programming&quot; 或 &quot;Generic-Pareto&quot;</strong>：算法名固定是 Genetic-Pareto，论文 abstract 第一句明确这是缩写来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GEPA 把&quot;prompt 演化&quot;从启发式 prompt engineering 升级为 reproducible 算法，三个组件（Genetic population / Pareto front / Reflective ASI）各司其职。Reflective 部分通过把 trajectory 反思成自然语言诊断信息，让单次 rollout 信息量比 scalar reward 高一两个数量级，因此能用 10^2-10^3 而非 10^5 量级的 rollout 完成有效优化。Hermes 把这套机制 plug 进 curator + skill_manage，得到一个不需要 model fine-tuning 就能持续演进的 personal-agent 工具栈。下一篇看在演进过程中 skill 版本与 rollback 如何管理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GEPA 反思式 prompt 演化（Genetic-Pareto）","id":"gepa-反思式-prompt-演化-genetic-pareto"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个核心组件","id":"三个核心组件"},{"level":3,"text":"Genetic：候选 population 与变异","id":"genetic-候选-population-与变异"},{"level":3,"text":"Pareto：多目标前沿选择","id":"pareto-多目标前沿选择"},{"level":3,"text":"Reflective：基于 trajectory 的自然语言诊断","id":"reflective-基于-trajectory-的自然语言诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"ASI 驱动的变异 prompt","id":"asi-驱动的变异-prompt"},{"level":2,"text":"System-aware merge","id":"system-aware-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"性能数字","id":"性能数字"},{"level":2,"text":"Hermes 的工程落地","id":"hermes-的工程落地"},{"level":2,"text":"与传统 RLHF 的对比","id":"与传统-rlhf-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Curator 周期 review skill 的 keep / refine / retire 决策","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/curator-skill-review-cycle"},"next":{"title":"Skill 版本管理与 rollback","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/skill-versioning-and-rollback"}}